        "id": 36528,
        "name": "Christopher",
        "username": "Christopher",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-08-22T13:45:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This sounds like a ton of fun!</p><p>Tachyon is always going to be overly strong against any villains after number 1, as you observed with her Burst cards in Trash. Conversely, Fanatic will have a rough time not burning herself out across multiple games, as her HP is one of her primary resources. Not that I think you shouldn't use those two. Just things you should be aware of going into it.</p><p>Thanks for sharing!</p>",
